      "block_id": "statement",
      "text": "Juniper Freight annual disclosures, USD millions. FY2021 runs from October 1, 2020 through September 30, 2021; FY2020 runs from October 1, 2019 through September 30, 2020. Columns: FY2021 FY2020.\nEast segment revenue 73 68\nConsolidated revenue 120 110\nConsolidated adjusted operating profit 11 10",
      "text_hash": "39f7b21a4c263d39299827729a7ccc9d4a415fd403dbdea2845eee1f1ff10c23"
    },
    {
      "source_snapshot_id": "juniper-source-b",
      "block_id": "notes",
      "text": "Note 2. Effective October 1, 2020, the East segment reporting boundary changed. The FY2020 East segment revenue amount of USD 68 million has been retrospectively recast for comparison with FY2021. FY2021 is reported directly on the new boundary and is not a retrospectively recast period. The boundary change did not affect consolidated financial statements for either FY2021 or FY2020. Consolidated adjusted operating profit is issuer-defined; see Note 9 for its adjustment definition and reconciliation.",
      "text_hash": "aebf85128b22002f11091f57829e44a80864f713e2e91842ee40243da523ab8c"
    }
  ],
